"Answer: x ≤ 6":"Respuesta: x ≤ 6",
"Add 4 to BOTH sides:###BAL:2x − 4,10;<;+4,+4;2x,14###":"Suma 4 en AMBOS lados:###BAL:2x − 4,10;<;+4,+4;2x,14###",
"Now divide BOTH sides by 2:###BAL:2x,14;<;÷2,÷2;x,7###":"Ahora divide AMBOS lados entre 2:###BAL:2x,14;<;÷2,÷2;x,7###",
"Answer: x < 7":"Respuesta: x < 7",
