"Subtract 3 from BOTH sides:###BAL:−3x + 3,−12;>;−3,−3;−3x,−15###":"Resta 3 en AMBOS lados:###BAL:−3x + 3,−12;>;−3,−3;−3x,−15###",
"Divide BOTH sides by −3 — the sign FLIPS:###BAL:−3x,−15;>;÷−3,÷−3;x,5;<###":"Divide AMBOS lados entre −3; el signo se VOLTEA:###BAL:−3x,−15;>;÷−3,÷−3;x,5;<###",
"Answer: x < 5":"Respuesta: x < 5",
