"Divide BOTH sides by −5 — the sign FLIPS:###BAL:−5x,20;≤;÷−5,÷−5;x,−4;≥###":"Divide AMBOS lados entre −5; el signo se VOLTEA:###BAL:−5x,20;≤;÷−5,÷−5;x,−4;≥###",
