"x + 2y = 10  and  x − y = 1":"x + 2y = 10  y  x − y = 1",
"Solve the second equation for x: x = 1 + y":"Despeja x en la segunda ecuación: x = 1 + y",
"Substitute: (1 + y) + 2y = 10 → 3y = 9 → y = 3":"Sustituye: (1 + y) + 2y = 10 → 3y = 9 → y = 3",
"Plug y = 3 back in: x = 1 + 3 = 4":"Pon y = 3 de vuelta: x = 1 + 3 = 4",
"Simplifying Rational Expressions":"Simplificar expresiones racionales",
"The gateway skill to rational equations and functions, used in science formulas for rates and densities.":"Es la habilidad que abre la puerta a las ecuaciones y funciones racionales, y se usa en fórmulas de ciencias para tasas y densidades.",
"Factor the numerator and the denominator completely. Cancel any factor that appears on BOTH the top and bottom. Then state the restriction: whatever x-value would make the ORIGINAL (unfactored) denominator equal 0 has to stay off-limits, even after that factor cancels.":"Factoriza por completo el numerador y el denominador. Cancela cualquier factor que aparezca ARRIBA y ABAJO. Luego indica la restricción: el valor de x que haría que el denominador ORIGINAL (sin factorizar) fuera igual a 0 sigue prohibido, aunque ese factor se cancele.",
"Numerator":"Numerador",
"The top number or expression in a fraction.":"El número o la expresión de arriba en una fracción.",
"In <span class='frac'><span class='frac-num'>3</span><span class='frac-den'>4</span></span>, the numerator is 3.":"En <span class='frac'><span class='frac-num'>3</span><span class='frac-den'>4</span></span>, el numerador es 3.",
"Denominator":"Denominador",
"The bottom number or expression in a fraction.":"El número o la expresión de abajo en una fracción.",
"In <span class='frac'><span class='frac-num'>3</span><span class='frac-den'>4</span></span>, the denominator is 4.":"En <span class='frac'><span class='frac-num'>3</span><span class='frac-den'>4</span></span>, el denominador es 4.",
"Canceling a Common Factor":"Cancelar un factor común",
"<div class='ex-legend'><span class='ex-purple'>PURPLE</span> = the factor that cancels, <span class='ex-blue'>BLUE</span> = the restriction it creates, <span class='ex-red'>RED</span> = the answer</div>":"<div class='ex-legend'><span class='ex-purple'>MORADO</span> = el factor que se cancela, <span class='ex-blue'>AZUL</span> = la restricción que crea, <span class='ex-red'>ROJO</span> = la respuesta</div>",
"<span class='step-label'>Step 1:</span> Factor the top: <span class='frac'><span class='frac-num'>x² − 9</span><span class='frac-den'>x + 3</span></span> → <span class='frac'><span class='frac-num'>(x − 3)(<span class='ex-purple'>x + 3</span>)</span><span class='frac-den'><span class='ex-purple'>x + 3</span></span></span>":"<span class='step-label'>Paso 1:</span> Factoriza el numerador: <span class='frac'><span class='frac-num'>x² − 9</span><span class='frac-den'>x + 3</span></span> → <span class='frac'><span class='frac-num'>(x − 3)(<span class='ex-purple'>x + 3</span>)</span><span class='frac-den'><span class='ex-purple'>x + 3</span></span></span>",
"<span class='step-label'>Step 2:</span> Cancel the matching <span class='ex-purple'>(x + 3)</span> on top and bottom":"<span class='step-label'>Paso 2:</span> Cancela el <span class='ex-purple'>(x + 3)</span> que se repite arriba y abajo",
"<span class='step-label'>Step 3:</span> Restriction: <span class='ex-blue'>x + 3</span> = 0 when x = −3":"<span class='step-label'>Paso 3:</span> Restricción: <span class='ex-blue'>x + 3</span> = 0 cuando x = −3",
"<span class='step-label'>Step 4:</span> Answer: <span class='ex-red'>x − 3, where x ≠ −3</span>":"<span class='step-label'>Paso 4:</span> Respuesta: <span class='ex-red'>x − 3, donde x ≠ −3</span>",
"Another Cancel":"Otra cancelación",
"<span class='step-label'>Step 1:</span> Factor the top: <span class='frac'><span class='frac-num'>x² − 4</span><span class='frac-den'>x − 2</span></span> → <span class='frac'><span class='frac-num'>(<span class='ex-purple'>x − 2</span>)(x + 2)</span><span class='frac-den'><span class='ex-purple'>x − 2</span></span></span>":"<span class='step-label'>Paso 1:</span> Factoriza el numerador: <span class='frac'><span class='frac-num'>x² − 4</span><span class='frac-den'>x − 2</span></span> → <span class='frac'><span class='frac-num'>(<span class='ex-purple'>x − 2</span>)(x + 2)</span><span class='frac-den'><span class='ex-purple'>x − 2</span></span></span>",
"<span class='step-label'>Step 2:</span> Cancel the matching <span class='ex-purple'>(x − 2)</span> on top and bottom":"<span class='step-label'>Paso 2:</span> Cancela el <span class='ex-purple'>(x − 2)</span> que se repite arriba y abajo",
"<span class='step-label'>Step 3:</span> Restriction: <span class='ex-blue'>x − 2</span> = 0 when x = 2":"<span class='step-label'>Paso 3:</span> Restricción: <span class='ex-blue'>x − 2</span> = 0 cuando x = 2",
"<span class='step-label'>Step 4:</span> Answer: <span class='ex-red'>x + 2, where x ≠ 2</span>":"<span class='step-label'>Paso 4:</span> Respuesta: <span class='ex-red'>x + 2, donde x ≠ 2</span>",
"<div class='ex-notice'>Notice: the purple factor cancels, but its blue restriction still carries over from the ORIGINAL denominator.</div>":"<div class='ex-notice'>Fíjate: el factor morado se cancela, pero su restricción azul se mantiene porque viene del denominador ORIGINAL.</div>",
