"<span class='step-label'>Step 2:</span> GCF of 8 and 12 is 4; smallest power of x in both is x² → GCF = <span class='ex-purple'>4x²</span>":"<span class='step-label'>Paso 2:</span> El MCD de 8 y 12 es 4; la potencia más pequeña de x en ambos es x² → MCD = <span class='ex-purple'>4x²</span>",
