"<span class='step-label'>Step 1:</span> f(x) = 2x + 3, find f(5) → substitute <span class='ex-purple'>x = 5</span>: f(5) = 2(5) + 3":"<span class='step-label'>Paso 1:</span> f(x) = 2x + 3, halla f(5) → sustituye <span class='ex-purple'>x = 5</span>: f(5) = 2(5) + 3",
"<span class='step-label'>Step 2:</span> Simplify: <span class='ex-blue'>10 + 3 = 13</span>":"<span class='step-label'>Paso 2:</span> Simplifica: <span class='ex-blue'>10 + 3 = 13</span>",
"<span class='step-label'>Step 3:</span> Answer: <span class='ex-red'>f(5) = 13</span>":"<span class='step-label'>Paso 3:</span> Respuesta: <span class='ex-red'>f(5) = 13</span>",
"<div class='ex-notice'>Notice: f(5) does NOT mean f times 5 — it means \"plug 5 in for x.\"</div>":"<div class='ex-notice'>Fíjate: f(5) NO significa f por 5; significa \"pon 5 en lugar de x\".</div>",
