"<span class='step-label'>Step 2:</span> Simplify: <span class='ex-blue'>9 − 4 = 5</span>":"<span class='step-label'>Paso 2:</span> Simplifica: <span class='ex-blue'>9 − 4 = 5</span>",
"<span class='step-label'>Step 3:</span> Answer: <span class='ex-red'>f(−3) = 5</span>":"<span class='step-label'>Paso 3:</span> Respuesta: <span class='ex-red'>f(−3) = 5</span>",
