"Multiplying Binomials (FOIL)":"Multiplicar binomios (FOIL)",
"This is the reverse of factoring — the same skill shows up constantly to check a factoring answer or expand an expression before solving.":"Es lo contrario de factorizar: esta misma habilidad aparece constantemente para comprobar una respuesta factorizada o para expandir una expresión antes de resolver.",
"Use FOIL: multiply the First terms, the Outer terms, the Inner terms, and the Last terms. Then combine any like terms you get.":"Usa FOIL: multiplica los términos Primeros (First), los Externos (Outer), los Internos (Inner) y los Últimos (Last). Luego combina los términos semejantes que te salgan.",
"FOIL":"FOIL",
"A memory trick for multiplying two binomials: First, Outer, Inner, Last.":"Un truco de memoria para multiplicar dos binomios: Primeros, Externos, Internos, Últimos (First, Outer, Inner, Last en inglés).",
"For (x+2)(x+3): First x·x, Outer x·3, Inner 2·x, Last 2·3.":"Para (x+2)(x+3): Primeros x·x, Externos x·3, Internos 2·x, Últimos 2·3.",
"x + 5 and 2x − 3 are both binomials.":"x + 5 y 2x − 3 son ambos binomios.",
"FOIL With All Positives":"FOIL con todos positivos",
"<div class='ex-legend'><span class='ex-purple'>PURPLE</span> = Outer + Inner (the middle term), <span class='ex-blue'>BLUE</span> = First and Last, <span class='ex-red'>RED</span> = the answer</div>":"<div class='ex-legend'><span class='ex-purple'>MORADO</span> = Externos + Internos (el término del medio), <span class='ex-blue'>AZUL</span> = Primeros y Últimos, <span class='ex-red'>ROJO</span> = la respuesta</div>",
"<span class='step-label'>Step 1:</span> (x + 2)(x + 5) — First: <span class='ex-blue'>x · x = x²</span>":"<span class='step-label'>Paso 1:</span> (x + 2)(x + 5) — Primeros: <span class='ex-blue'>x · x = x²</span>",
"<span class='step-label'>Step 2:</span> Outer + Inner: <span class='ex-purple'>x·5 + 2·x = 5x + 2x = 7x</span>":"<span class='step-label'>Paso 2:</span> Externos + Internos: <span class='ex-purple'>x·5 + 2·x = 5x + 2x = 7x</span>",
"<span class='step-label'>Step 3:</span> Last: <span class='ex-blue'>2 · 5 = 10</span>":"<span class='step-label'>Paso 3:</span> Últimos: <span class='ex-blue'>2 · 5 = 10</span>",
"<span class='step-label'>Step 4:</span> Answer: <span class='ex-red'>x² + 7x + 10</span>":"<span class='step-label'>Paso 4:</span> Respuesta: <span class='ex-red'>x² + 7x + 10</span>",
"<div class='ex-notice'>Notice: Outer + Inner always combine into the single middle term.</div>":"<div class='ex-notice'>Fíjate: Externos + Internos siempre se combinan en un solo término del medio.</div>",
"FOIL With a Negative":"FOIL con un negativo",
"<span class='step-label'>Step 1:</span> (x − 3)(x + 4) — First: <span class='ex-blue'>x · x = x²</span>":"<span class='step-label'>Paso 1:</span> (x − 3)(x + 4) — Primeros: <span class='ex-blue'>x · x = x²</span>",
"<span class='step-label'>Step 2:</span> Outer + Inner: <span class='ex-purple'>x·4 + (−3)·x = 4x − 3x = x</span>":"<span class='step-label'>Paso 2:</span> Externos + Internos: <span class='ex-purple'>x·4 + (−3)·x = 4x − 3x = x</span>",
"<span class='step-label'>Step 3:</span> Last: <span class='ex-blue'>(−3) · 4 = −12</span>":"<span class='step-label'>Paso 3:</span> Últimos: <span class='ex-blue'>(−3) · 4 = −12</span>",
"<span class='step-label'>Step 4:</span> Answer: <span class='ex-red'>x² + x − 12</span>":"<span class='step-label'>Paso 4:</span> Respuesta: <span class='ex-red'>x² + x − 12</span>",
"<div class='ex-notice'>Notice: carry each term's sign into First, Outer, Inner, and Last — it's the most common slip.</div>":"<div class='ex-notice'>Fíjate: lleva el signo de cada término a los Primeros, Externos, Internos y Últimos — es el descuido más común.</div>",
"First: x · x = x²":"Primeros: x · x = x²",
"Outer + Inner: x·6 + 1·x = 7x":"Externos + Internos: x·6 + 1·x = 7x",
"Last: 1 · 6 = 6":"Últimos: 1 · 6 = 6",
