"<span class='step-label'>Step 1:</span> x² + 10x + 25 — square roots of the outer terms: <span class='ex-purple'>√x² = x, √25 = 5</span>":"<span class='step-label'>Paso 1:</span> x² + 10x + 25 — raíces cuadradas de los términos de los extremos: <span class='ex-purple'>√x² = x, √25 = 5</span>",
"<span class='step-label'>Step 2:</span> Check the middle term: <span class='ex-blue'>2 × x × 5 = 10x ✓</span> matches":"<span class='step-label'>Paso 2:</span> Comprueba el término del medio: <span class='ex-blue'>2 × x × 5 = 10x ✓</span> coincide",
"<span class='step-label'>Step 3:</span> Answer: <span class='ex-red'>(x + 5)²</span>":"<span class='step-label'>Paso 3:</span> Respuesta: <span class='ex-red'>(x + 5)²</span>",
