"Solving Quadratics by Factoring":"Resolver cuadráticas por factorización",
"The fastest way to solve a quadratic when it factors nicely — no formula needed, just the Zero Product Property.":"La forma más rápida de resolver una cuadrática cuando se factoriza bien — sin fórmula, solo la Propiedad del Producto Cero.",
"Get the equation equal to 0 first. Factor the quadratic completely. Set EACH factor equal to 0 separately (Zero Product Property) and solve each mini-equation for x.":"Primero iguala la ecuación a 0. Factoriza la cuadrática por completo. Iguala CADA factor a 0 por separado (Propiedad del Producto Cero) y resuelve cada mini-ecuación para x.",
"Zero Product Property":"Propiedad del Producto Cero",
"If two factors multiply to 0, at least one of them must itself be 0.":"Si dos factores se multiplican y dan 0, al menos uno de ellos tiene que ser 0.",
"If (x−2)(x+3)=0, then x−2=0 or x+3=0.":"Si (x−2)(x+3)=0, entonces x−2=0 o x+3=0.",
"Factoring Then Solving":"Factorizar y luego resolver",
"<div class='ex-legend'><span class='ex-purple'>PURPLE</span> = the factored form, <span class='ex-blue'>BLUE</span> = each mini-equation, <span class='ex-red'>RED</span> = the answer</div>":"<div class='ex-legend'><span class='ex-purple'>MORADO</span> = la forma factorizada, <span class='ex-blue'>AZUL</span> = cada mini-ecuación, <span class='ex-red'>ROJO</span> = la respuesta</div>",
"<span class='step-label'>Step 1:</span> x² + x − 6 = 0 — factor: <span class='ex-purple'>(x + 3)(x − 2) = 0</span>":"<span class='step-label'>Paso 1:</span> x² + x − 6 = 0 — factoriza: <span class='ex-purple'>(x + 3)(x − 2) = 0</span>",
"<span class='step-label'>Step 2:</span> Set each factor to 0: <span class='ex-blue'>x + 3 = 0</span> or <span class='ex-blue'>x − 2 = 0</span>":"<span class='step-label'>Paso 2:</span> Iguala cada factor a 0: <span class='ex-blue'>x + 3 = 0</span> o <span class='ex-blue'>x − 2 = 0</span>",
"<span class='step-label'>Step 3:</span> Solve each: x = −3 or x = 2":"<span class='step-label'>Paso 3:</span> Resuelve cada una: x = −3 o x = 2",
"<span class='step-label'>Step 4:</span> Answer: <span class='ex-red'>x = −3 or x = 2</span>":"<span class='step-label'>Paso 4:</span> Respuesta: <span class='ex-red'>x = −3 o x = 2</span>",
