"<span class='step-label'>Step 1:</span> y = (x − 4)² + 1 — compare to (x − h)²: <span class='ex-purple'>h = 4</span>":"<span class='step-label'>Paso 1:</span> y = (x − 4)² + 1 — compara con (x − h)²: <span class='ex-purple'>h = 4</span>",
"<span class='step-label'>Step 2:</span> The number added at the end is k: <span class='ex-blue'>k = 1</span>":"<span class='step-label'>Paso 2:</span> El número que se suma al final es k: <span class='ex-blue'>k = 1</span>",
