"Find the vertex of y = (x − 2)² + 7. ###GRAPH:parabola;1,2,7;y = (x − 2)² + 7###":"Halla el vértice de y = (x − 2)² + 7. ###GRAPH:parabola;1,2,7;y = (x − 2)² + 7###",
