"Restriction: x + 2 = 0 when x = −2":"Restricción: x + 2 = 0 cuando x = −2",
"Answer: 3, where x ≠ −2":"Respuesta: 3, donde x ≠ −2",
"<span class='frac'><span class='frac-num'>1</span><span class='frac-den'>x</span></span> + <span class='frac'><span class='frac-num'>1</span><span class='frac-den'>3</span></span> = ?  (common denominator is 3x)":"<span class='frac'><span class='frac-num'>1</span><span class='frac-den'>x</span></span> + <span class='frac'><span class='frac-num'>1</span><span class='frac-den'>3</span></span> = ?  (el denominador común es 3x)",
