"<span class='step-label'>Step 1:</span> y varies directly with x; y = 12 when x = 4 → <span class='ex-purple'>k = y/x = 12/4 = 3</span>":"<span class='step-label'>Paso 1:</span> y varía directamente con x; y = 12 cuando x = 4 → <span class='ex-purple'>k = y/x = 12/4 = 3</span>",
"<span class='step-label'>Step 2:</span> Find y when x = 7: <span class='ex-blue'>y = kx = 3 × 7</span>":"<span class='step-label'>Paso 2:</span> Halla y cuando x = 7: <span class='ex-blue'>y = kx = 3 × 7</span>",
"<span class='step-label'>Step 3:</span> Answer: <span class='ex-red'>y = 21</span>":"<span class='step-label'>Paso 3:</span> Respuesta: <span class='ex-red'>y = 21</span>",
"<div class='ex-notice'>Notice: once you know k, direct variation is just y = kx every time.</div>":"<div class='ex-notice'>Fíjate: una vez que conoces k, la variación directa es siempre y = kx.</div>",
"<span class='step-label'>Step 1:</span> y varies inversely with x; y = 6 when x = 5 → <span class='ex-purple'>k = xy = 5 × 6 = 30</span>":"<span class='step-label'>Paso 1:</span> y varía inversamente con x; y = 6 cuando x = 5 → <span class='ex-purple'>k = xy = 5 × 6 = 30</span>",
"<span class='step-label'>Step 2:</span> Find y when x = 10: <span class='ex-blue'>y = k/x = 30/10</span>":"<span class='step-label'>Paso 2:</span> Halla y cuando x = 10: <span class='ex-blue'>y = k/x = 30/10</span>",
"<span class='step-label'>Step 3:</span> Answer: <span class='ex-red'>y = 3</span>":"<span class='step-label'>Paso 3:</span> Respuesta: <span class='ex-red'>y = 3</span>",
