"Find k: k = xy = 3 × 4 = 12":"Halla k: k = xy = 3 × 4 = 12",
"Use y = k/x: y = 12/6":"Usa y = k/x: y = 12/6",
"y varies directly with x. y = 15 when x = 3. Find x when y = 25.":"y varía directamente con x. y = 15 cuando x = 3. Halla x cuando y = 25.",
"Find k: k = y/x = 15/3 = 5":"Halla k: k = y/x = 15/3 = 5",
